          "  <skill>",
          "    <name>conexus-build</name>",
          "    <description>Builds an approved plan, or a small change with nothing left to decide, in small steps proved by the check and by reading the code against the plan. Covers what to do when a step fails or the work leaves the plan, keeping the code clean, and finishing. Use before changing an app&apos;s code.</description>",
          "    <location>inline/conexus-build/SKILL.md</location>",
