          "    <description>How an app saves data and runs logic on the server. Covers the operations in `shared/operations.ts` written in Zod, their handlers in `server/handlers.ts` with `query` and `write`, tables and migrations, who is calling, the values PostgreSQL gives back, reading the company&apos;s connected systems (Sankhya, Mercado Livre), failures and the limits of a call. Use before designing an app&apos;s tables or changing `shared/operations.ts` or anything in `server/`.</description>",
          "    <location>inline/conexus-data/SKILL.md</location>",
